  "title": "Republic Airways Holdings Inc. Announces Q1 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "Republic Airways Holdings Inc. (NASDAQ: RJET) (the “Company” or “Republic”) today reported financial results for the first quarter of 2026 and reaffirmed its outlook for the full year 2026. The Company’s consolidated results reported in the first quarter of 2026 include the results of Mesa Air Group, Inc. (“Mesa”) while comparable prior periods exclude any Mesa results because the merger of Republic Airways Holdings Inc. and Mesa Air Group, Inc. was consummated on November 25, 2025 (the “Merger”",
